            <ArticleTitle>The avoidance of suxamethonium pain: a study of patients presenting for laparos copy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>97-102</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A comparison was made of the incidence of post-operative pain in patients given suxamethonium modified by pre-treatment with a small dose of gallamine and those not given suxamethonium. Sequential analysis of the results showed a preference for anaesthetic techniques not employing suxamethonium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
